      "id": "O01",
      "question": "What is the refund timeline after I return an item?",
      "answered": true,
      "reply": "After you return an item, a refund is initiated within 7 days of the item being received at the warehouse. For card and bank credits, the refund appears within 5 to 7 further business days depending on the bank. For cash on delivery refunds via bank transfer, the transfer is initiated within 7 days and the amount reaches the account within 3 to 5 business days.",
      "citations": [
